# The repo root sets "* text=auto eol=lf", which is right for the C sources
# and wrong for these: cmd.exe does not accept a bare LF as a line ending, and
# a .bat checked out with LF fails with garbled labels and "command not found".
# .bat and .cmd must keep CRLF in the repository, not just in the checkout.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
